    "text": "<p>Putting,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>Differentiating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
